WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.661
Factoring with zero error.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.616
Shor's algorithm usually succeeds. This circuit, using

3
00:00:05.616 --> 00:00:08.029
one fixed gate set, always does.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.056
Make each trial succeed exactly one time

5
00:00:11.056 --> 00:00:13.313
in four, then amplify that to certainty.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.920
Claimed: exact factoring in polynomial time.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:19.059
Lean-checked main theorem.
